OL,3,ARobert Pattinson named as new James
OL,4,ABond, ending long hunt for Daniel
OL,5,ACraig's replacement
OL,6,
OL,7,FRobert Pattinson has been named as the
OL,8,Fnew James Bond - watch as London's
OL,9,FPiccadilly Circus shares the news
OL,11,FIn a statement, the 40-year-old British
OL,12,Factor says "to be entrusted with 007 is
OL,13,Fthe honour of a lifetime"
OL,15,FPattinson's career spans two decades -
OL,16,Fperhaps best known for playing vampire
OL,17,FEdward Cullen in the Twilight films, he
OL,18,Fhas also starred in Harry Potter and,
OL,19,Fmore recently, Christopher Nolan's The
OL,20,FOdyssey
