OL,3,ARobert Pattinson named as new James
OL,4,ABond, ending long hunt for Daniel
OL,5,ACraig's replacement
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeaky Blinders creator Steven Knight
OL,8,Fhas been writing the script for the
OL,9,Fnext film, with Dune's Denis Villeneuve
OL,10,Fto direct - what we do, and don't, know
OL,11,Fabout the film
OL,13,FWho else was in the race to play Bond?
OL,14,FSee our full list
OL,16,FThanking those who auditioned,
OL,17,FVilleneuve says "we were surrounded by
OL,18,Fextraordinary talent", adding Pattinson
OL,19,F"brings a spirit that is completely
OL,20,Fnew"
